@* =====================================================================
   FILE:    Views/Shared/_ValidationScriptsPartial.cshtml
   PURPOSE: Loads jQuery Validation, so forms are checked in the browser using
            the same data annotations as the server ([Required], [Range], ...).
            Every form page includes it in its Scripts section. The server still
            validates again, because browser checks can be switched off.
   ===================================================================== *@
<script src="~/lib/jquery-validation/dist/jquery.validate.min.js"></script>
<script src="~/lib/jquery-validation-unobtrusive/dist/jquery.validate.unobtrusive.min.js"></script>
